#. Description of the theme
#: style.css
msgid "A warm, editorial, mobile-first blog theme for long-form writing — cream \"paper\" palette, serif reading column with a sans UI, a cinematic hero, a sticky reading sidebar, quote/pull-quote styling, and ad-native spacing. Fast and light (system fonts, no jQuery, light mode). Pairs with the WP Automator Pro plugin: header/sidebar/footer ad zones and native in-content ad styling. English throughout."
msgstr ""

